{"title":"Euclid 2019/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclid_2019/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) Michelle calculates the average of the following numbers: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/2/d6202a123b667bf1273cfdd002dbd7b8c17cbc9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5, 10, 15, 16, 24, 28, 33, 37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"195\" height=\"17\" />. Daphne removes one number and calculates the average of the remaining numbers. The average that Daphne calculates is one less than the average that Michelle calculates. Which number does Daphne remove?\n</p><p>(b) If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/e/58e28cf8c96819e983ef73817145e12f468f36e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16^{\\frac{15}{x}}=32^{\\frac43}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"19\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p>(c) Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/d/2cdea86e4995d8ff8b3c587aaf03565188868f94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{2022}+2^a}{2^{2019}}=72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"124\" height=\"41\" />. Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclid_2019/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) The average of the original set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/d/67ddf7998871baa4f865ec711db9ba15f772b5b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5+10+15+16+24+28+33+37}{8}=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"340\" height=\"38\" />, so the new average must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb9e41e1ede2020ba55899e127ff45405b750ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21-1=20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />. Because the original sum of the numbers was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/1/c7116bbc884d2cf49e25754864ae00d9c42d2d90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$168$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> and the new sum of the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/0/7c0fdf117c488fb64ea36abd673077b705c0b775.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\times 7=140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, so the number taken off must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/b/8bb349a59ae5497f527088a6f5c1044c2e024b51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$168-140=\\boxed{28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"132\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>(b) After writing both sides of the equation in powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50d1b9166d2d1aa7b3d0fda7b4315a863dcf9c95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{4^{\\frac{15}{x}}}=2^{5^{\\frac43}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"24\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/0/170bd1dfe5c5d34d5ffb09a2b5c614ced5668bcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{\\frac{60}{x}}=2^{\\frac{20}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/3/b33e715f6e8f1d1759e9f94b26270e84584757ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{x}=\\frac{20}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a985973171b56527c67e5fac599dc298fc419bf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180=20x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6f2533bf9a49668a029a6d36fc11bd33ddea31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>(c) Let's write the left side as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/4/334bccfc4cc3705f9ee009c57b9f96af82416c70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{2022}}{2^{2019}}+\\frac{2^a}{2^{2019}}=2^3+2^{a-2019}=8+2^{a-2019}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"331\" height=\"41\" />. So, after subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from both sides, we will get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/6/826df634bea59461ac4513547bbbfc0c00f7691c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{a-2019}=64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c57e9ba4d1846efad0815d99c25f5135492ff91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{a-2019}=2^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af05ae94e8ef2b6f72c7e4b9916df934195d66a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-2019=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/c/f4c17f56b0199856ad3f42358024a6c3c9504cbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\boxed{2025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"83\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018083742\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 81/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4157/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:34450:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018083742 and revision id 285365. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}